  <item>
    <title>最难的事情是破除理想主义的滤镜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6704897f81cdab3a935f60c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6704897f81cdab3a935f60c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 01:23:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家国庆假期过得怎么样呢？感觉越来越能接受节气回来上班的那种落差了，虽然假期人真的很多，但是还是希望利用这个时间出去看看外面的时间，分享一下这次旅行中所思考的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 假期小总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 对于INFJ最需要改变的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 小时候的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a> 最近很喜欢的两个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 总结&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luoaMIKoUQuq1jO5pd8z3HqLnTpU.m4a" length="10632970" type="audio/mp4"/>
